What do I need to start?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"An email and $20. Fund with a card or crypto, turn on Auto, and you're live in about 10 minutes. $RAIN is optional."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I keep full control?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Always. You set stake sizes, strategies, and exits. Trades execute from your own wallet and you can pause the agent or withdraw at any time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need experience?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"If you already trade games on DraftKings, FanDuel, or Kalshi, you're ready. C9, Rainmaker's AI agent, does the reads, entries, and exits. You only set your stake."}}]}</script><div class="relative min-h-screen scroll-smooth overflow-x-hidden font-sans text-zinc-900 [&amp;_.marketing-copy]:font-pixel"><div class="fixed inset-0 z-0" aria-hidden="true"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(168deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fafc 40%, #f1f5f9 100%)"></div><div class="absolute -left-[10%] -top-[12%] h-[min(70vw,620px)] w-[min(70vw,620px)] rounded-full will-change-transform" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.9) 0%, rgba(248,250,252,0.35) 40%, transparent 72%);filter:blur(52px);animation:holo-spot-white 58s ease-in-out infinite"></div><div class="absolute -left-[8%] -top-[8%] h-[min(58vw,520px)] w-[min(58vw,520px)] rounded-full will-change-transform" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(186,230,253,0.19) 0%, rgba(56,189,248,0.14) 28%, rgba(14,165,233,0.09) 48%, rgba(125,211,252,0.04) 62%, transparent 76%);filter:blur(64px);animation:holo-spot-cyan 72s ease-in-out infinite"></div><div class="absolute h-[min(44vw,400px)] w-[min(44vw,400px)] rounded-full will-change-transform" style="left:55%;top:45%;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(125,211,252,0.16) 0%, rgba(14,165,233,0.08) 42%, transparent 74%);filter:blur(56px);animatio