="rounded-[10px] bg-[#141416] p-2.5 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.10)_inset] "><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0EE957]"></span><span class="text-[10px] text-zinc-300">Email verified</span></span><span class="text-[9px] text-[#757575]">No invite</span></div><div class="mt-2 text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-white">you@gmail.com</div></div><div class="rounded-full bg-[#0EE957]/[0.08] py-2 text-center text-[10.5px] font-medium text-[#0EE957] shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(14,233,87,0.15)_inset]">Account created</div><div class="text-center text-[9px] text-[#757575]">Open to everyone · $RAIN optional</div></div><h3 class="mb-1.5 text-base font-semibold text-zinc-950">1. Create your account</h3><p class="marketing-copy text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">Sign up with an email in about two minutes. No invite, no crypto experience needed.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="mb-4 flex aspect-[4/3] flex-col gap-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] border border-white/[0.05] p-3 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.10)_inset]" style="background:linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0) 34%, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 100%), #0D0D0F"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">Polymarket wallet</span><div class="rounded-[10px] bg-[#141416] p-2.5 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.10)_inset] "><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-2 py-1 text-[9px] font-medium text-zinc-400">0x8f3…a2C4</span><span class="text-[9px] text-[#757575]">Deposit wallet</span></div><div class="mt-2.5 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[9px] text-[#757575]">Balance</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">$500.00 <span class="text-[9px] font-normal text-[#757575]">USD</span></span></div></div><div class="rounded-full bg-[#0EA5E9] py-2 text-center text-[10.5px] font-medium text-white">Add funds · card or crypto</div><div class="text-center text-[9px] text-[#757575]">Your wallet, your funds · withdraw anytime</div></div><h3 class="mb-1.5 text-base font-semibold text-zinc-950">2. Fund your Polymarket wallet</h3><p class="marketing-copy text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">Add funds with a card or crypto, from $20. Everything lands in your own Polymarket wallet.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="mb-4 flex aspect-[4/3] flex-col gap-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] border border-white/[0.05] p-3 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.10)_inset]" style="background:linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0) 34%, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 100%), #0D0D0F"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">Dashboard</span><span class="rounded-lg border border-[#0EE957]/20 bg-[#0EE957]/[0.08] px-2 py-1 text-[9px] font-medium text-[#0EE957]">AI active</span></div><div class="rounded-[10px] bg-[#141416] p-2.5 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.10)_inset] "><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><img alt="LAD team logo" loading="lazy" width="36" height="36" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 object-contain" style="color:transparent;width:18px;height:18px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Flad.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Flad.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Flad.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><span><span class="block text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-white">LAD @ WSH</span><span class="block text-[8.5px] text-[#757575]">41 Yes @ 58¢ · now 62¢</span></span></span><span class="text-right text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-[#0EE957]">+$6.42<span class="block text-[8.5px] font-normal">+27%</span></span></div><div class="mt-1.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-[7px] border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.04] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[8.5px] font-semibold text-zinc-300"><img alt="LAD team logo" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 object-contain" style="color:transparent;width:12px;height:12px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Flad.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Flad.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Flad.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><span class="text-[#0EE957]">LAD 4</span><span class="text-zinc-500">–</span><img alt="WSH team logo" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 object-contain" style="color:transparent;width:12px;height:12px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fwsh.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fwsh.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fwsh.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><span>2 WSH</span><span class="font-normal text-[#757575]">· Top 7th</span></div></div><div class="rounded-[10px] bg-[#141416] p-2.5 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.10)_inset] "><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><img alt="NYY team logo" loading="lazy" width="36" height="36" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 object-contain" style="color:transparent;width:18px;height:18px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fnyy.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fnyy.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fnyy.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><span><span class="block text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-white">NYY @ TOR</span><span class="block text-[8.5px] text-[#757575]">88 Yes @ 55¢ · now 58¢</span></span></span><span class="text-right text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-[#0EE957]">+$11.20<span class="block text-[8.5px] font-normal">+23%</span></span></div></div></div><h3 class="mb-1.5 text-base font-semibold text-zinc-950">3. Turn on Backspin</h3><p class="marketing-copy text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">Set your stake and flip the switch. Backspin+ trades live tennis matches for you — entries and exits, starting with today&#x27;s tour.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="mb-4 flex aspect-[4/3] flex-col gap-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] border border-white/[0.05] p-3 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.10)_inset]" style="background:linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0) 34%, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 100%), #0D0D0F"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">Portfolio</span><span class="flex gap-1"><span class="rounded-md bg-white/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[8px] text-white">7D</span><span class="rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[8px] text-[#757575]">30D</span><span class="rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[8px] text-[#757575]">All Time</span></span></div><div class="rounded-[10px] bg-[#141416] p-2.5 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.10)_inset] px-2.5 py-1.5"><div class="text-base font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-white">$1,842.50</div><div class="text-[9.5px] font-medium text-[#0EE957]">▲ +$284.17 (18%)</div></div><div class="rounded-[10px] bg-[#141416] p-2.5 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.10)_inset] flex flex-col gap-1 p-1.5"><div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-white/[0.02] px-2 py-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><img alt="MIA team logo" loading="lazy" width="36" height="36" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 object-contain" style="color:transparent;width:18px;height:18px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fmia.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fmia.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fmia.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><span><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-white">MIA<span class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[8px] font-medium text-zinc-400">Tennis Backspin</span></span><span class="block text-[8.5px] text-[#757575]">62¢ → 100¢ · Settled</span></span></span><span class="text-right text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-[#0EE957]">+$23.40<span class="block text-[8.5px] font-normal">+60%</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-white/[0.02] px-2 py-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><img alt="TEX team logo" loading="lazy" width="36" height="36" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 object-contain" style="color:transparent;width:18px;height:18px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Ftex.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Ftex.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Ftex.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><span><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-white">TEX<span class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[8px] font-medium text-zinc-400">Tennis Backspin</span></span><span class="block text-[8.5px] text-[#757575]">52¢ → 100¢ · Settled</span></span></span><span class="text-right text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-[#0EE957]">+$34.10<span class="block text-[8.5px] font-normal">+91%</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-white/[0.02] px-2 py-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><img alt="STL team logo" loading="lazy" width="36" height="36" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 object-contain" style="color:transparent;width:18px;height:18px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fstl.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fstl.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.espncdn.com%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fmlb%2F500%2Fstl.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><span><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-white">STL<span class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[8px] font-medium text-zinc-400">Tennis Backspin</span></span><span class="block text-[8.5px] text-[#757575]">47¢ → 0¢ · Settled</span></span></span><span class="text-right text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-[#FF0066]">−$25.00<span class="block text-[8.5px] font-normal">−100%</span></span></div></div></div><h3 class="mb-1.5 text-base font-semibold text-zinc-950">4. Track &amp; share winnings</h3><p class="marketing-copy text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">Every settled trade lands in your portfolio history. Share your P&amp;L card, withdraw anytime.</p></div></div><div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-2.5"><a class="tennis-activate-cta relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-[#0EA5E9] font-medium text-white px-7 py-3 text-[15px] shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(14,165,233,0.28)]" href="/retail-onboarding"><span class="relative z-10">Activate Backspin+</span></a><span class="marketing-copy text-[12px] text-zinc-500">Step one takes about two minutes.</span></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 md:px-10 lg:px-14"><h2 class="text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,2.6rem)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.8px] text-zinc-950">This is the app.</h2><p class="marketing-copy mt-3 max-w-[52ch] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">Not renders. These are the actual screens: live scores with Backspin&#x27;s thinking orb on the games it&#x27;s in, one tap into any game, and positions settling in your own wallet.</p><div class="mt-12 flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-5 overflow-x-auto pb-4 [-ms-overflow-style:none] [scrollbar-width:none] md:grid md:grid-cols-4 md:gap-6 md:overflow-visible md:pb-0 [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden"><div class="w-[236px] shrink-0 snap-center md:w-auto"><div class="select-none rounded-[38px] border border-white/[0.10] bg-[#111113] p-2 shadow-[0_24px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border border-white/[0.06] bg-[#08080B]"><img alt="Live scores" loading="lazy" width="390" height="844" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fscores.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fscores.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fscores.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W"/></div></div><div class="mt-4 px-1"><div class="text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-zinc-950">Live scores</div><p class="marketing-copy mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">Every game with win odds moving in real time. The orb marks games Backspin is working.</p></div></div><div class="w-[236px] shrink-0 snap-center md:w-auto"><div class="select-none rounded-[38px] border border-white/[0.10] bg-[#111113] p-2 shadow-[0_24px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border border-white/[0.06] bg-[#08080B]"><img alt="Tap into any game" loading="lazy" width="390" height="844" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fgame.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fgame.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fgame.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W"/></div></div><div class="mt-4 px-1"><div class="text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-zinc-950">Tap into any game</div><p class="marketing-copy mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">Highlights, streaming plays, and the live win-probability chart.</p></div></div><div class="w-[236px] shrink-0 snap-center md:w-auto"><div class="select-none rounded-[38px] border border-white/[0.10] bg-[#111113] p-2 shadow-[0_24px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border border-white/[0.06] bg-[#08080B]"><img alt="One switch" loading="lazy" width="390" height="844" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fauto.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fauto.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fauto.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W"/></div></div><div class="mt-4 px-1"><div class="text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-zinc-950">One switch</div><p class="marketing-copy mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">Set your stake per trade and turn on Auto. That is the whole job.</p></div></div><div class="w-[236px] shrink-0 snap-center md:w-auto"><div class="select-none rounded-[38px] border border-white/[0.10] bg-[#111113] p-2 shadow-[0_24px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border border-white/[0.06] bg-[#08080B]"><img alt="Share the win" loading="lazy" width="390" height="844" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fshare.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fshare.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fapp%2Fshare.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_J6FhEhYAkaSXQA6T6qf6UnR6q17W"/></div></div><div class="mt-4 px-1"><div class="text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-zinc-950">Share the win</div><p class="marketing-copy mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">Any position becomes a card you can post in one tap.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="rain" class="scroll-mt-28 py-20" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 md:px-10 lg:px-14"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-zinc-200/80 bg-white/80 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm"><div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 p-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:p-14"><div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#0ea5e9]/25 bg-[#0ea5e9]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0ea5e9]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0ea5e9]"></span>For holders</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(1.6rem,2.6vw,2rem)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-zinc-950">$RAIN is the quiet advantage.</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-[#0ea5e9]/80">Optional. Everything works without it.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-[44ch] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">You don&#x27;t need <b class="font-medium text-zinc-900">$RAIN</b>to trade, and we won&#x27;t push it. Holders get the perks we don&#x27;t advertise: lower fees, first in line when one signal fires for thousands of wallets at once, a bigger cut on referrals. Funds stay in<!-- --> <b class="font-medium text-zinc-900">your own Polymarket wallet</b> either way.</p><div class="mt-5"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-zinc-500">Token address · Solana</div><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="flex max-w-full items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[10px] border border-zinc-200 bg-white/80 px-3 py-2.5 text-left transition-colors hover:border-[#0ea5e9]/40" title="Copy token address"><span class="truncate font-mono text-[12px] text-zinc-700">3iC63FgnB7EhcPaiSaC51UkVweeBDkqu17SaRyy2pump</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-zinc-400" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><a href="https://dexscreener.com/solana/69au8dkw4xxrza6hosi4fibmykjt6uefo9o4crus4vne" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="shrink-0 rounded-[10px] border border-zinc-200 bg-white/80 px-3 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-medium text-zinc-700 transition-colors hover:border-zinc-300 hover:text-zinc-900">Chart</a></div></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col justify-center gap-3 md:ml-auto md:max-w-[360px]"><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 rounded-[14px] border border-zinc-200/80 bg-white/60 px-4 py-3.5 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#0ea5e9]/35 hover:bg-[#0ea5e9]/[0.06]"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0ea5e9]/70">01</span><span class="text-sm text-zinc-700">Lower trading fees</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 rounded-[14px] border border-zinc-200/80 bg-white/60 px-4 py-3.5 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#0ea5e9]/35 hover:bg-[#0ea5e9]/[0.06]"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0ea5e9]/70">02</span><span class="text-sm text-zinc-700">Priority fills when signals get crowded</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 rounded-[14px] border border-zinc-200/80 bg-white/60 px-4 py-3.5 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#0ea5e9]/35 hover:bg-[#0ea5e9]/[0.06]"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0ea5e9]/70">03</span><span class="text-sm text-zinc-700">Boosted referral payouts</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 rounded-[20px] border border-zinc-200/80 bg-white/80 p-7 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between md:px-9"><div><div class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-950">Bought $RAIN?</div><div class="mt-1 text-[13.5px] text-zinc-600">Join our Discord for setup support.</div></div><a href="https://discord.gg/2GzbAYBxxq" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-fit shrink-0 rounded-full border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-[15px] font-medium text-zinc-800 transition-colors hover:border-zinc-400">Join Discord</a></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 rounded-[20px] border border-zinc-200/80 bg-white/80 p-7 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between md:px-9"><div><div class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-950">No $RAIN yet?</div><div class="mt-1 text-[13.5px] text-zinc-600">You don&#x27;t need any. Sign up, add funds, turn the AI on.</div></div><a class="tennis-activate-cta relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-[#0EA5E9] font-medium text-white px-6 py-3 text-[15px] shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(14,165,233,0.28)] w-fit" href="/retail-onboarding"><span class="relative z-10">Activate Backspin+</span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="faq" class="scroll-mt-28 pb-20 pt-10" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 md:px-10 lg:px-14"><h2 class="mb-12 text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,2.6rem)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.8px] text-zinc-950">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-3 lg:grid-cols-2"><div data-slot="accordion" class="flex flex-col gap-3" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accord