market wallet the entire time. You can withdraw whenever you want.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What do I need to start?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"An email and $20. Fund with a card or crypto, turn on Auto, and you're live in about 10 minutes. $RAIN is optional.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I keep full control?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Always. You set stake sizes, strategies, and exits. Trades execute from your own wallet and you can pause the agent or withdraw at any time.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need experience?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"If you already trade games on DraftKings, FanDuel, or Kalshi, you're ready. C9, Rainmaker's AI agent, does the reads, entries, and exits. You only set your stake.\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"8:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Rainmaker\\\",\\\"alternateName\\\":[\\\"Rainmaker AI\\\",\\\"Rainmaker.fun\\\"],\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://rainmaker.fun\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"https://rainmaker.fun/icon.png\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Rainmaker is a fully autonomous AI sports trading agent for Polymarket. It analyzes live sports markets, chooses trades, sizes positions, and executes entries and exits automatically from user-owned wallets — no picks, no copy trading, no strategy building — with a public settled track record.\\\",\\\"sameAs\\\":[\\\"https://x.com/rainmakerdotfun\\\",\\\"https://discord.gg/2GzbAYBxxq\\\",\\\"https://dexscreener.com/solana/69au8dkw4xxrza6hosi4fibmykjt6uefo9o4crus4vne\\\"]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$1c\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{\"initialRecord\":{\"ok\":true,\"since\":\"2026-06-01\",\"wins\":38,\"losses\":17,\"settled\":55,\"record